{"id":15329,"slug":"ted-lasso-2020","title":"Ted Lasso","title_en":"Ted Lasso","year":2020,"rating":87,"votes_count":5,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":"2020-08-14","plot":"Jason Sudeikisje Ted Lasso. Trenér amerického fotbalu. Přestože s evropským fotbalem nemá žádné zkušenosti, stěhuje se do Anglie, kde ho najali, aby trénoval fotbalový tým. Půjde to, „jako když Lassem mrská“, i když jsou hráči cyničtí a město nepřátelské?(Apple TV+)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/169/130/169130410_cchixx.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie","Drama","Sportovní"],"tags":["fotbal","americký fotbal"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Tom Marshall","Declan Lowney","Elliot Hegarty","Zach Braff","M.J. Delaney","Ezra Edelman","Erica Dunton","Matt Lipsey","Sam Jones","Destiny Ekaragha"],"actors":["Jason Sudeikis","Brendan Hunt","Stephen Manas","Nick Mohammed","Bronson Webb","Juno Temple","Hannah Waddingham","Jeremy Swift","Teresa Mahoney","James Lance","Phil Dunster","Brett Goldstein","Toheeb Jimoh","Annette Badland","Kola Bokinni","Craig Conway","Shaun Prendergast","Daniel Eghan","Jimmy Akingbola","Anthony Head","Keeley Hazell","Susan Tracy","Anwar Lynch","Andrea Anders","Ellie Taylor","Kieran O'Brien","Andrew Bradley","Sarah Niles","Cristo Fernández","Ruth Bradley","Patrick Baladi","David Elsendoorn","Hugh Futcher","Bill Fellows","Raffaello Degruttola","Emilio Doorgasingh","Claire Skinner","Thomas Howes","Harriet Walter","Rich Keeble","Phoebe Walsh","Sidse Babett Knudsen","Sofia Barclay","Nonso Anozie","Thierry Henry","Charlotte Spencer","Jason Hillhouse","Dan Brothers","Alice Nokes","Tom Parry","Bill Paterson","Charlie Rawes","Ninette Finch","Sam Richardson","Kiki May","Elodie Blomfield","Katy Wix","Maximilian Osinski","Ambreen Razia","Mike O'Gorman","Precious Mustapha","Tim Bentinck","Stephen Frost","Edyta Budnik","Jodi Balfour","Jadran Malkovich","Peter Landi","Matteo van der Grijn","Carly Wijs","Carolina Dijkhuizen","Mary Roubos","Corey Burton","Mark Kempner","Malcolm Rennie","Ryan Stiles","Colin Mochrie","Andy Umerah","Steve Edge","Moe Jeudy-Lamour","Darren Strange","Chanelle Sadie Paul","Chi Lewis-Parry","Peter Crouch","Becky Ann Baker","Ben Mars","Bill Skinner","Daniel Fearn","Tino Orsini"],"screenwriters":["Bill Lawrence","Jason Sudeikis","Joe Kelly","Jane Becker","Brett Goldstein","Bill Wrubel","Brendan Hunt","Leann Bowen","Ashley Nicole Black","Phoebe Walsh","Jamie Lee","Sasha Garron","Chuck Hayward","Keeley Hazell","Dylan Marron"],"cinematographers":["David Rom","John Sorapure","Ryan Kernaghan","Vanessa Whyte"],"composers":["Marcus Mumford","Tom Howe"],"reviews":[{"author":"BoXBe","text":"Všechno, čím jsem nečekal, že seriál Ted Lasso bude, tím je a čím víc tím je, tím je lepší. Buduje charaktery, královsky baví a udržuje solidně vysokou laťku, přinejmenším po celou první sérii, kterou jsem teď dokoukal. Vryl se do paměti, zůstane určitě vryt na dlouho, tím jsem si jistý a určitě bude tím sitcomem, ke kterému se s chutí budu vracet. Takových není mnoho, času není nazbyt. Ale s touhle partičkou je to fakt do pohody.(10.10.2021)","stars":4},{"author":"Superpero","text":"Megapříjemný, pohodový seriál. Ted Lasso je totální optimista a dobrou náladu dokáže převést i na mě :) O to víc oceňuji, že mu tvůrci házeli klacky pod nohy a i když se mu třeba v životě něco kurvilo, furt byl na všechny až na výjimky dobrák. Z vedlejších postav byl asi nejlepší stárnoucí, věčně nasranej kapitán mužstva.(31.10.2020)","stars":4},{"author":"arcticsky","text":"No jo, všichni si potřebujeme odpočinout u nějaké té moderní pohádky, kde všechno \"sedí\" jako zadek na nočníku. Oproti skutečnému životu zde není nic přehnaně komplikované, navíc je to dobře zahrané typově vhodnými herci a herečkami. Za pár dní jsem sjel všechny tři série jako nic. Budou mi scházet suše vtipné motivační proslovy od Teda, neuvěřitelná milfka Hannah Waddingham, bezprostřední tele Juno Temple a ostatní.(01.11.2025)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Apple TV+","url":null},{"platform":"Apple TV","url":"https://srv.clickfuse.com/ads/adclkr.php?id=100006636&url=https%3A//tv.apple.com/cz/show/ted-lasso/umc.cmc.vtoh0mn0xn7t3c643xqonfzy"},{"platform":"Canal+","url":"https://www.canalplus.cz/stream/series/ted-lasso/serie-1/epizoda-1/?utm_campaign=vod_content&utm_content=feed&utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=partner&utm_term="}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/867768-ted-lasso/prehled/","root_id":867768,"root_title_id":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":4,"episode_count":44,"is_running":true,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2020-04-04","last_vod_date":"2026-08-26","episodes":[{"season_no":1,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2020-08-21","title":"Pro děti","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2020-04-28","title":"Vypálené plavky","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2020-04-04","title":"Dvě esa","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":7,"vod_date":"2020-09-11","title":"Ať žije Rebecca","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":"2020-09-18","title":"Diamantové dogy","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":9,"vod_date":"2020-09-25","title":"Samé omluvy","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":10,"vod_date":"2020-10-02","title":"Naděje tě zabije","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":2,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2021-07-23","title":"Sbohem, Earle","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":2,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2021-07-30","title":"Levandule","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":2,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2021-08-06","title":"Udělat tu nejsprávnější věc","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple T